# Flutter Build Configuration Rules

## Pubspec.yaml Configuration

• Pin Flutter version to 3.35.0+
• Use Dart SDK 3.8.0 minimum
• Set publish_to none for apps
• Define clear app description
• Use semantic versioning format

```yaml
environment:
  sdk: '>=3.8.0 <4.0.0'
  flutter: ">=3.35.0"

name: monica_companion
version: 0.0.1
publish_to: 'none'
```

## Core Dependencies Management

• Use Flutter SDK for core framework
• Pin cupertino_icons for iOS styling
• Include equatable for value objects
• Add flutter_svg for vector graphics
• Lock dependency versions precisely

```yaml
dependencies:
  flutter:
    sdk: flutter
  cupertino_icons: ^1.0.2
  equatable: ^2.0.5
  flutter_svg: ^2.0.10+1
```

## Development Dependencies

• Include flutter_test for unit testing
• Add integration_test for e2e testing
• Use flutter_lints version 6.0.0
• Include build_runner for code generation
• Add mocktail for test mocking

```yaml
dev_dependencies:
  flutter_test:
    sdk: flutter
  integration_test:
    sdk: flutter
  flutter_lints: ^6.0.0
  build_runner: ^2.4.7
  mocktail: ^1.0.0
```

## Code Generation Setup

• Include json_annotation for serialization
• Add json_serializable for generation
• Configure build_runner properly
• Support future code generation needs
• Version code generation packages consistently

```yaml
  json_annotation: ^4.8.1
  json_serializable: ^6.7.1
```

## Asset Configuration

• Use Material Design components
• Organize assets in subdirectories
• Place logos in dedicated folder
• Prepare font configuration structure
• Use asset path prefixes correctly

```yaml
flutter:
  uses-material-design: true
  assets:
    - assets/images/logos/
```

## Android Build Configuration

• Use Flutter Gradle Plugin
• Set namespace to package structure
• Configure compile SDK dynamically
• Use Java 8 compatibility
• Enable build config features

```gradle
plugins {
    id "com.android.application"
    id "kotlin-android"
    id "dev.flutter.flutter-gradle-plugin"
}

android {
    namespace = "fr.m0hdaCorp.monica_companion"
    compileSdk = flutter.compileSdkVersion
}
```

## Build Types Configuration

• Configure debug with application suffix
• Set debuggable flags appropriately
• Enable minification for release
• Use ProGuard for code obfuscation
• Configure profile build properly

```gradle
buildTypes {
    debug {
        applicationIdSuffix '.debug'
        debuggable true
    }
    release {
        debuggable false
        minifyEnabled true
        proguardFiles getDefaultProguardFile('proguard-android-optimize.txt')
    }
}
```

## Application Identity

• Use reverse domain notation
• Set clear application ID
• Configure version codes dynamically
• Define readable app names
• Prepare for flavor configurations

```gradle
defaultConfig {
    applicationId = "fr.m0hdaCorp.monica_companion"
    minSdkVersion = flutter.minSdkVersion
    targetSdkVersion = flutter.targetSdkVersion
    versionCode = flutter.versionCode
    versionName = flutter.versionName
}
```

## Build Configuration Fields

• Define flavor-specific configurations
• Set API base URL variables
• Configure environment-specific settings
• Use string resources for app names
• Enable build config generation

```gradle
buildConfigField "String", "FLAVOR", '"development"'
buildConfigField "String", "API_BASE_URL", '"https://dev-api.monica.com"'
resValue "string", "app_name", "Monica Companion"
```

