## Kotlin Configuration

• Use Kotlin Android plugin
• Target Java 8 compatibility
• Configure JVM target properly
• Include Kotlin standard library
• Match Java source compatibility

```gradle
kotlinOptions {
    jvmTarget = JavaVersion.VERSION_1_8
}

dependencies {
    implementation "org.jetbrains.kotlin:kotlin-stdlib-jdk7:$kotlin_version"
}
```

## Flutter Source Configuration

• Point to correct Flutter source
• Use relative path to project root
• Configure Flutter build properly
• Enable Flutter-specific features
• Support hot reload and restart

```gradle
flutter {
    source = "../.."
}
```

